/** The online tier: creators from followed sources. Those with a profile open onto their creator profile page; those without have their whole batch
 *  on the follows page, and opening equals "Follows · this person"; when the database has a same-named creator awaiting user confirmation, the count reads "pending",
 *  and opening goes to that person's profile page, where the confirm button lives. `data-follow-author` carries the follows page's creator keys. */

/* The readings say what the server is running right now, so they expand and collapse with the saved switch: if they appeared the moment the switch flipped,
     the written state would still be the previous one, and "local folder watch · not running" would read as "turning it on is useless".
     What needs filling (the prefix table) follows the toggle the other way, otherwise it could only be filled after one save. */

/** The queue header's two lines: category and summary. The edition queue's title is "Editions · code", but the code is printed in the details title directly above,
 *  and the title bar already says "Editions"; three places saying one thing, so only the count stays here. Other queues' titles carry real information (playlist name,
 *  Mix seed) and cannot be cut along with it. */

/* Inner dot: absolutely centered (flex centering of fractional sizes can
          land on subpixels) and no drop shadow — a downward shadow makes the
          dot read as sitting below center. */

/* 外观与版式Settings的Apply层（@peach/appearance）: 偏好 store、Start归一化、文档属性、CSS 变量与版式开关.
 * Application 与 React 页面引用同一份源码，随 peach-app.js 发出.
 * 路由与目录的 JAV、首页判据由 application/layout.js 计算后作为参数传入. */

/* Playback器模块: 命令式 TypeScript，不进入 React 渲染.
 * Video.js 接管 video 宿主与控件 DOM；舞台和沉浸的 effect 调 mountPlayer 并Save清理函数.
 * Application 与 React 页面共享源码图，宿主、Playback器槽位、流会话与右键菜单状态各只有一份. */

/* 标签选择器: Recently used + All（或搜索结果），上下键挑、回车加，输入的词没有完全命中就多一格
   「New」.开合走全站菜单那一对口（`presentMenu`／`dismissMenu`），`hidden` 由它们管.
   选字过程中框里是半截拼音，筛选按 `term` 走、组完字才跟上，不拿「zhon」去筛. */

/* 竖屏格（竖屏带与筛竖屏的网格）只展示竖屏比例的视频，卡面只用视频自己的帧图；番号作品也
     不走官方Cover，「JAV 默认Cover」Settings在这里不起作用: 那张Cover是整部作品的宣传图，多是横图，
     和这一卷竖屏视频不是同一个画面.没有帧图就是「No preview」. */

/* 共享控件导出清单: Application 与 React 页面按 @peach/legacy/ui 或源码路径引用.
 * 别名直接指向本文件，控件随 peach-app.js 发出一份，类型检查也读同一清单.
 * 独立页面包仅将用到的控件直接打进自己的产物. */

/* 独立页面包的 @peach/legacy/ui 别名落点（vite.pages.config.ts）.
 * 主界面的同名别名指向 ui-kit/index.ts；独立页面只直接打包实际使用的折叠与来源站标.
 * 导出清单缺名时由构建检查拒绝. */

/* 卡片图片、人脸取景与悬停Preview（@peach/card-art）.
 * Application 与 React 页面引用同一份源码，随 peach-app.js 发出.
 * 代表作表、悬停配置与文档监听全站只有一份. */

/* 数据库里一律存 UTC（ISO 带 Z），界面要按看的人所在时区显示.第二个页面要用就搬进
 * 这里，不各写一份: 两处各自解释「没有时区标记的算哪一边」的话，同一个时间会在两页上
 * 差出八小时. */
